{"seq":6,"trial_id":"gbrain-arm-2026-10/qm-pi-sonnet-gbrain-mu-heldout/sc-05-hartford-postmortem/r1","wall_ts":"2026-10-24T21:28:33.777Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"8f5ff46500ff8b81b2b64f70415b2e8886601792b285c5319ea69e73e102d28a","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C1MTZS8410N","text":"Gideon, you first reported the kiosks offline in #inc-vtg-hartford at 10:42 AM on 3 Aug. You wrote that both inbound lanes showed a white screen after badge scan.\n\nWhile the kiosks were down, the guard wrote trailer numbers on a clipboard. That was still the method when you posted at 10:42. Nothing in the channel says how long the clipboard was used. The log shows the following:\n- **11:03 AM:** Mateo said kiosk 1 was back. The guard checked in trailer 8836 and dispatch could see it.\n- **11:07 AM:** You confirmed both lanes were working.\n\nSo the clipboard stretched from at least 10:42 to about 11:03 for kiosk 1. It lasted until about 11:07 if kiosk 2 stayed down until then.\n\nDuring that window, Mateo reported six trucks waiting at the east gate at 10:44. He also said door 14 needed the resin delivery before the afternoon shift."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C1MTZS8410N","ts":"1791986400.000124"}}
{"seq":7,"trial_id":"gbrain-arm-2026-10/qm-pi-sonnet-gbrain-mu-heldout/sc-05-hartford-postmortem/r1","wall_ts":"2026-10-24T21:28:33.777Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"cf36ec8642157c622d58ad019d8060eb5d5e418fecda3bf2273879b4e7ebc0c7","actor":"ruth-calloway","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C1MTZS8410N","text":"And mine: which ticket holds the status-page screenshot for Mateo's access problem?"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C1MTZS8410N","ts":"1791986400.000125"}}
{"seq":8,"trial_id":"gbrain-arm-2026-10/qm-pi-sonnet-gbrain-mu-heldout/sc-05-hartford-postmortem/r1","wall_ts":"2026-10-24T21:28:36.552Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"277d53fd29564eeb79065bd00944d68b31ba2874c7e3168e7b159b0289c6312e","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C1MTZS8410N","text":"Ruth, the status-page screenshot is attached to ticket INC-4821. Gideon said so in #inc-vtg-hartford on 3 Aug at 11:08 AM. He wrote that he was \"still chasing status-page access; screenshot attached to ticket INC-4821.\"\n\nThat message is the only place I found the ticket named. I haven't opened INC-4821 itself, so I can't confirm the screenshot is there."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C1MTZS8410N","ts":"1791986400.000126"}}
